{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"annuity-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"annuity-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["annuity-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Aplica una tasa anual nominal fija dividida por la frecuencia de pago a una serie de pagos iguales.Los pagos ordinarios se realizan al final de cada período; los pagos de anualidad se realizan al comienzo.No modela comisiones, impuestos, tasas variables o un contrato de aseguradora específico.","record_id":"1642d8d81059b8a72a5fd242f421fdcaba54de5ae1f6cd609b9d236c9c756e8b","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.6822562948749464,"source":"It applies a fixed nominal annual rate divided by the payment frequency to a series of equal payments. Ordinary payments happen at each period’s end; annuity-due payments happen at the beginning. It does not model fees, taxes, variable rates or a specific insurer’s contract.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"cd98a0edf1c8ace46a9cb275ad87467dc4b59ddb56b491233742c140df9ee1ff","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Aplica una tasa anual nominal fija dividida por la frecuencia de pago a una serie de pagos iguales.Los pagos ordinarios se realizan al final de cada período; los pagos de anualidad se realizan al comienzo.No modela comisiones, impuestos, tasas variables o un contrato de aseguradora específico.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
