{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"average-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.4","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"average-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.4","keys":["average-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.4"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"La calificación final requerida asume que la calificación actual cubre todo el trabajo antes de la final. La fórmula es (objetivo × ZXQPH0000QXZ - actual × (ZXQPH0001QXZ - peso final)) / peso final.Las calificaciones actual y objetivo van de cero a cien, y el peso final es positivo.","record_id":"165413feb8e9e2d2be85c032d2535d1af72c241b24fcd0fe3619b737a4691a67","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.2453723216250125,"source":"Required final grade assumes the current grade covers all work before the final. The formula is (target × 100 - current × (100 - final weight)) / final weight. The current and target grades lie from zero to one hundred, and the final weight is positive.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"e56bede094fe34ce1a9b66564f543f0582e6afdfae64fca828e3eac09fbeab32","status":"machine-draft","translation":"La calificación final requerida asume que la calificación actual cubre todo el trabajo antes de la final. La fórmula es (objetivo × 100 - actual × (100 - peso final)) / peso final.Las calificaciones actual y objetivo van de cero a cien, y el peso final es positivo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
